# www/ — Static Site for paint.type Project

## Purpose

The `www/` directory contains the official static website for the paint.type
project, including documentation, guides, and project information. The site
is generated using casket-ssg (pinned to v0.1.4, commit 8c3b772b144e59df29c66cb1a8c3d9a4b276ff11)
with strict security headers and a documented escaping contract.

## Canonical Files

- `README.adoc` — Directory documentation and security information
- `0.2-AI-MANIFEST.a2ml` — This AI manifest

## Directory Structure by Functional Grouping

### Templates

* `templates/default.html` — Main HTML template with CSP and security headers

### Security Configuration

* `security_headers/csp.conf` — Content Security Policy and HTTP headers

### Well-Known Resources

* `.well-known/` — RFC 8615 well-known URI endpoints

### Resource Records

* `resource_records/` — Security manifests and resource declarations

## Security Invariants

### site-security-headers
- description: www/ directory contains security_headers directory with CSP configuration
- run: test -d "www/security_headers" && test -f "www/security_headers/csp.conf"
- severity: critical

### site-well-known
- description: www/ directory contains .well-known directory for RFC 8615 resources
- run: test -d "www/.well-known"
- severity: warning

### site-resource-records
- description: www/ directory contains resource_records directory for manifests
- run: test -d "www/resource_records"
- severity: warning

### casket-ssg-pinned
- description: casket-ssg is pinned to a specific version in www/README.adoc
- run: grep -q "8c3b772b144e59df29c66cb1a8c3d9a4b276ff11" www/README.adoc
- severity: critical

### csp-in-template
- description: default.html template contains Content-Security-Policy meta tag
- run: grep -q "Content-Security-Policy" www/templates/default.html
- severity: critical

### escaping-contract-documented
- description: Escaping contract for casket-ssg templates is documented
- run: grep -q "Escaping Contract" www/README.adoc
- severity: critical

